SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 1e-3
    Ba 1e-3

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0 1.0
        -steps 100*10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_kinetics.sel
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -kinetics Calcite
